 with quadrant shower Spacious bedroom with king-size extending bed Perfect for exploring the waterways with family and friends.','One','N/A','yes – Pullman style','16ft – including dinette','Pullman dinette with 2 armchairs','Yes – opposite dinette','Yes – Hamlet 4KW','Engine, Webasto & immersion heater','10/6/4mm','Cruiser','N/A','Saloon 24in Smart TV – By separate negotiation','Stainless steel','240 litres approx.','Quick release under rear deck','Combination of single glazed windows & port holes','2021','Narrowboats','N/A',0,0,0,99950),(299,'1976','boat brokers product images/SENTINEL/SENTINEL03.jpg',1,'2026-09-10 09:46:27.411','2026-09-10 09:46:27.411','Single','18 (9 down each side) – OK at last blacking','Cooker only','Concrete slabs','Large rectangular shower with curtain',NULL,'4ft 3in','Porta Potti','Yes – with vanity cupboard, shelving & mirror','N/A','1 x starter 12V 80Ah + 6 x leisure 6V 225Ah','4ft fixed double / Single bed in Boatmans cabin','No','Underbed storage',NULL,'May 2024','sentinel','Valid till 2030','N/A','No','Brian Duvall','White painted ply','10mm T&G pine','2 radiators fed from stove back boiler','N/A','£69,950','No','70584','300+litres approx.','BSS/Various user/installation manuals','30in','Beta Marine 6.6KVA generator in acoustic housing/ Solar panels 1055W','Bolinder 1503',NULL,'January 2026 (Rebuilt in 1992)','Not specified','Oak effect vinyl flooring','Freestanding New World 4 burner cooker','Shaker style kitchen with soft close doors & drawers, stainless steel sink','240V fridge','8ft 2in','No','Yes – Indesit 7kg','Yes','3 x 13kg stern lockers','Bolinder','N/A','Not registered','Brian Duvall','White painted ply','Sprayfoam',NULL,'5ft 10in (centre)','1500W inverter & Victron 80Amp charger','Yes – Stern','January 2026','70ft','TBC','12V LED lights throughout',NULL,'sentinel','Various','2 + 2','Sentinel is a characterful 70ft traditional narrowboat built in 1976 by Brian Duvall and powered by the much-admired Bolinder engine, perfectly complementing her classic lines and timeless appeal. Stepping aboard from the bow, you are welcomed into a spacious saloon, followed by a well-equipped walkthrough galley featuring a freestanding cooker, washing machine, fridge freezer and ample storage. The light and airy main bedroom offers a comfortable retreat, while the impressive engine room houses the iconic Bolinder engine and generator enabling life aboard to be completely self sufficient. Completing the accommodation is a traditional boatman’s cabin with a single berth, full of charm and surprisingly spacious. Sentinel is a rare opportunity to own a traditional narrowboat with an abundance of character and heritage.','Two or more','May 2024 (available on request)','No','14ft 3in','Sofabed','Yes – Saloon, bedroom & engine room','Yes – with back boiler feeding 2 radiators','Engine & immersion heater','10/6/6mm','Trad','May 2024 – available on request','Saloon 42in Samsung Smart TV & 24in Sharp TV in bedroom','Mild steel','986 litres approx.','Quick release under rear deck','Single glazed port holes','1976','Narrowboats','N/A',0,0,0,69950),(300,'2022','boat brokers product images/SUNFLOWER/SUNFLOWER02.jpg',1,'2026-09-10 09:46:27.432','2026-09-10 09:46:27.432','45Amp','4','Electric oven/grill with induction hob','Concrete slabs & engineering bricks','Large 1200mm rectangular shower with glass screen',NULL,'6ft 1in','Jabsco toilet','Table top washbasin with vanity cupboard & mirror','525 litres','1 x starter 110Ah & Lithium 48V LifePO4 600Ah','Bedroom 1: 4ft fixed double bed Bedroom2: Double with option to convert to 2 single beds','L-shaped','Full height wardrobes in both bedrooms',NULL,'Two pack epoxy 2022','sunflower','Valid till 2028','December 2025','Lewmar 185TT electric','Tim Tyler','Plywood – covered in foam backed marine vinyl.','Epoxy coated plywood – White','Eberspacher heating 4 radiator throughout plus towel radiator','GB-TRYTT013C222','£129,950','No','530210','217 litres','BSS/Various user/inst